"Enable Unseen" = "启用 Unseen";

"Hide Recording State" = "隐藏录屏状态";

"Hide Screenshot Events" = "隐藏截图行为";

"Made with ♥ by OwnGoal Studio" = "「乌龙工作室」倾情献制";

"Please support our paid works, thank you!" = "请支持我们的付费作品，谢谢！";

"Protect System UI" = "保护系统界面";

"Restart Rendering Services" = "重启渲染服务";

"Restart backboardd and SpringBoard to reload rendering-related settings immediately." = "重启 backboardd 和 SpringBoard，让渲染相关设置立即重新载入。";

"Reveal Hidden Content" = "显示被隐藏的画面";

"When enabled, screenshots and recordings avoid showing system interface elements that should remain hidden." = "开启后，截图和录屏会尽量避免显示本应隐藏的系统界面。";

"When disabled, Unseen will not handle hidden content, screenshot notices, or screen recording state. Restart rendering services after changing these settings." = "关闭后，Unseen 不会处理隐藏画面、截图通知和录屏状态。更改设置后请重启渲染服务使其生效。";

"When enabled, apps can usually no longer learn that the screen is being recorded or mirrored through the system capture-state notification." = "开启后，App 通常无法再通过系统录屏状态通知得知屏幕正在被录制或投放。";

"When enabled, apps can usually no longer learn when you take a screenshot through the system screenshot notification." = "开启后，App 通常无法再通过系统截图通知得知你何时截屏。";

"When enabled, screenshots and recordings can show ordinary app content that was hidden with private layer flags. This does not bypass DRM or system copyright protections." = "开启后，截图和录屏会尽量显示 App 通过私有接口标记为隐藏的普通画面；此功能不会绕过 DRM 或系统版权保护。";
